#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Read-only Pyth Benchmarks + Hiro deployment/freshness scanner.

This script fetches public historical signed BTC/USD price updates, computes ordered
high->low price pairs, validates confidence bounds, and checks the exact four-Stacks-
block freshness condition used by Hermetica minting-auto-v1-2.

It performs no state-changing blockchain calls.
"""
